WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.836
(squeaking)
(slow music)

00:00:04.836 --> 00:00:09.836
(whimpers)

00:00:13.794 --> 00:00:15.849
(stiffled sob)

00:00:19.256 --> 00:00:21.044
- Man are you crying?

00:00:21.044 --> 00:00:22.704
- Nah dude, are you crying?

00:00:22.704 --> 00:00:24.121
(sobs)

00:00:24.121 --> 00:00:26.244
- No man, I'm chilling.

00:00:26.244 --> 00:00:28.858
- (sobs) I'm chilling too, dude.

00:00:28.858 --> 00:00:31.399
(both bawl)

00:00:31.399 --> 00:00:34.244
- You have a cat and my
allergies are kicking in.

00:00:34.244 --> 00:00:37.657
(both bawl)

00:00:37.657 --> 00:00:38.981
- I feel like it's leaking in here,

00:00:38.981 --> 00:00:40.861
so is it raining outside?

00:00:40.861 --> 00:00:42.081
I should probably get the roofs checked.

00:00:42.081 --> 00:00:45.703
(bawling)
(whimpering)

00:00:45.703 --> 00:00:49.359
- Hey man, it's okay.

00:00:49.754 --> 00:00:51.138
- I'm not crying, dude.

00:00:51.138 --> 00:00:54.189
I told you I didn't even wanna
watch The Lion King anyway.

00:00:54.189 --> 00:00:56.952
- Alright, I'll just change the channel.

00:00:56.952 --> 00:00:59.505
- [Voiceover] And now,
back to The Bachelorette.

00:00:59.505 --> 00:01:02.152
(both bawl)

00:01:02.152 --> 00:01:06.992
(upbeat music)

00:01:06.992 --> 00:01:08.858
(squeaking)

